rong enough to beat a trainer at Mt. Moon B2F, then push on toward Cerulean City. Bigger picture: Reach Cerulean City, beat Misty for the Cascade Badge. Your team right now: wartortle (L22), mankey (L9), spearow (L9). Remember YOU are the one playing this — narrate your plan to chat in your own voice (first person: "I\'m grinding", "my team"), and never ask anyone what you\'re doing or who\'s on your team — you know.', 'progress': "1 badge(s) earned (Boulder). Next gym: Misty of Cerulean City. Pokédex: 4 caught. She's one badge in — the adventure's really starting (of 8 badges, then the Elite Four).", 'party': 'wartortle (L22), mankey (L9), spearow (L9)', 'goal': {'short': 'Train the team toward ~L8 (or catch one more teammate), THEN retry', 'medium': 'Build a team strong enough to beat a trainer at Mt. Moon B2F, then push on toward Cerulean City', 'long': 'Reach Cerulean City, beat Misty for the Cascade Badge'}} options=['head_to_gym', 'battle', 'travel:3,3', 'travel:3,1', 'travel:3,5', 'travel:3,26']

